Hi, friend!This is a game ready  (Low Poly) model of a coin. Its toon design let it fit your cartoon projects (whether it is a pirate adventure game or a toon car racing). If you are bored with this old school golden coin styles you can use any of the 9 types I've prepared for you. You can use a mystery purple or an aggressive dark green for any case. By the way, if none of them fits your needs you can make your materials as well. That is incredibly easy and takes less than a minute to config a new bunch. 
Speaking about the polycount, it is the smallest number you can imagine thinking about such a model.
Total polycount: 109 faces!
109 faces for a ONE coin allows you to put as many of them on your scene as you wish.
While creating any game in this genre it is vital to place somewhere some rewards for the player, some golden (or any other) coins. That's why such awarding is an undeniable part - to encourage the person who is going to play the game.
Separate meshes:
Just one COIN itself (but in 9 configurations)

  - Default golden coin;

  - Mystery purple;

  - Cyan - White;

  - Red - Green;

  - Elegant Black & White;

  - Red - Purple;

  - Green - White;

  - Girl's edition: Pink;

  - Green - Black..

Features:

  - All of the popular file formats (FBX, OBJ, DAE, BLEND, X3D);

  - File names (textures & meshes) are simple to understand;

  - Easy and interesting modification;

  - Low polycount;

  - Royalty-free licence.

If you have any questions/suggestions or issues with the asset feel free to inform me, I am ready to help you any time! Please, write that in a comment section or contact me on my e-mail: andriyandriy1956@outlook.com
Thank you!
Your 3D artist,Andriy Bobchuk

